# Implementation Plan: Apple-Inspired Premium UI

This plan details the transformation of the existing auth flow into a high-end experience inspired by Apple's design language.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This implementation will introduce `framer-motion` for fluid animations.
> The design uses **Inter** as a replacement for SF Pro to maintain open-source compatibility while achieving the same aesthetic.

## Proposed Changes

---

### Design System & Global Styles
#### [MODIFY] [tailwind.config.ts](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/tailwind.config.ts)
- Add `backdrop-blur` utilities.
- Define custom shadows (Apple-style "soft" shadows).
- Add specific radius (12px/14px) and gray scales.

#### [NEW] [src/app/globals.css](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/app/globals.css)
- Re-create with lens-flare background animations.
- Define selection colors and smooth scroll behaviors.

---

### UI Library (`src/components/ui`)
#### [NEW] `GlassCard.tsx`
Base container with `backdrop-filter: blur` and subtle borders.

#### [NEW] `FloatingInput.tsx`
Input field with label that moves to the border on focus.

#### [NEW] `PremiumButton.tsx`
iOS-style interaction with ripple and scale effects.

---

### Auth Components (`src/components/auth`)
#### [MODIFY] `LoginForm.tsx`
- Minimalist layout.
- Animated FaceID placeholder.
- Gradient border on focus.

#### [MODIFY] `RegisterForm.tsx`
- Multi-step progress bar (Apple-style).
- Password requirement chips with green illumination and bounce.

#### [NEW] `LogoutOverlay.tsx`
- Full-screen blur overlay.
- Animated stroke SVG checkmark.

---

### Transitions
- Using `AnimatePresence` from Framer Motion for horizontal slide transitions between pages.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Build verification: `npm run build`.
- Check for accessibility (aria-labels on all inputs).

### Manual Verification
- Test "Swipe" feeling on mobile (simulated or real device).
- Dark Mode toggle: Verify background metal brushed effect vs dark zinc.
- Verify "Lens flare" animation is subtle and non-distracting.
